 x; margin-bottom: 8px;">Anahata ASI Update Center: Universal Cross-Ve
 rsion NetBeans Installer</h3><p style="font-size: 11px; margin-bottom
 : 0; color: #4a5568;">A lightweight, standalone NetBeans Platform mod
 ule with zero implementation locks. Provides automated NetBeans versi
 on detection, dynamic Anahata ASI Update Center catalog registration 
 (Universal, Stable, and Dev Snapshots), and 1-click installation of A
 nahata ASI Studio and JavaFX runtimes across all NetBeans versions (N
 B 21 &ndash; NB 35+).</p></div><div style="margin: 20px 0; padding: 1
 5px; background: #f7fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: left
 ;"><h4 style="margin-top: 0; color: #2d3748; font-size: 15px; text-tr
