 e Center Features</h4><ul style="color: #4a5568; font-size: 12px; mar
 gin: 0; padding-left: 20px;"><li><b>Zero Version Lock-in:</b> Relies 
 exclusively on public OpenIDE APIs. Survives NetBeans upgrades withou
 t breakage.</li><li><b>Dynamic Catalog Routing:</b> Automatically res
 olves the exact update catalog for your active NetBeans major release
 .</li><li><b>1-Click Installation:</b> Seamlessly downloads, validate
 s, and installs Anahata ASI Studio from within the IDE.</li><li><b>Ja
 vaFX Activation:</b> Verifies host JDK JavaFX runtime support and act
 ivates the NetBeans JavaFX kit when needed.</li><li><b>Legacy Center 
 Cleanup:</b> Detects and removes obsolete update centers from previou
 s NetBeans versions.</li></ul></div><hr style="border: 0; border-top:
